    "ls|LS16_S9_U_195": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF TOURISM \n \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.†195 \nANSWERED ON 18.07.2016 \n \nSIM CARDS TO E-VISA BEARERS \n \n†195. SHRI AJAY MISRA TENI:  \n \nWill the Minister of TOURISM be pleased to state:  \n \n(a)  whether the Government proposes to pro vide SIM cards to \ntourists coming from overseas on e-tourist visa;  \n(b)  if so, the details thereof;  \n(c)  the details of the facilities and information provided through \nsuch SIM cards to the foreign tourists; and  \n(d)  whether the number of foreign touris ts visiting the country is \nlikely to increase by making available SIM cards to these \ntourists? \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF STATE FOR TOURISM (INDEPENDENT CHARGE) \n(DR. MAHESH SHARMA) \n \n(a) to (d): Yes, Madam.  The Ministry of Tourism proposes to \npresent foreign tour ists arriving in India using e -Tourist Visa, a \nWelcome Kit containing inter alia a SIM Card for their \ncommunication in India. \n \nProvision of Welcome Kit/SIM Card is a tourist friendly gesture \nintended to facilitate the foreign tourists. \n \n******** \n \n ",
